   "preuve": "Verbatim 10-K FY2025 : «Profit was $8.884 billion in 2025, compared with $10.792 billion in 2024» ; «Construction Industries' profit was $4.675 billion in 2025, a decrease of $1.490 billion, or 24 percent» ; prix défavorables de 817 M$ (10-K FY2025)."
